s/1656640/extras/226c3b686d759ce59bb7bb6f027f8888.webm?t=1785584248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656640/extras/226c3b686d759ce59bb7bb6f027f8888.mp4?t=1785584248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the default white, the springboard has four colors. Each time you pass an obstacle, you will change the color. When you encounter the springboard with the same color as the ball, the jump range will be higher than usual~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold coins settled after passing the level can unlock skin and other rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656640/extras/450d686ebad275872479331030f06f23.poster.avif?t=1785584248\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656640/extras/450d686ebad275872479331030f06f23.webm?t=1785584248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656640/extras/450d686ebad275872479331030f06f23.mp4?t=1785584248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation guide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A, D or ←→ key to control the movement of the small ball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656640/extras/47a36f7ff3d0a83cc1bb7806737c7ced.poster.avif?t=1785584248\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656640/extras/47a36f7ff3d0a83cc1bb7806737c7ced.webm?t=1785584248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.